Louis Ghost. [[Philippe Starck]], France, 2000.

The outline of a Louis XVI armchair from the 1700s, molded in clear polycarbonate.

An old ornate shape in a new slick material. History as a costume.

Compare the [[Broom Chair]], also Starck.

